{"synopsis":"Perang wilayah di sekolah menengah yang terjalin dengan pengkhianatan, balas dendam, dan sisa-sisa persahabatan!\n\nPertarungan sengit antara Shin Woo-jae dan Yang Seon-tae, teman lama yang berubah jadi musuh, menjadi pertempuran intens untuk balas dendam dan kebenaran.\n\nDi tengah hierarki dominasi sekolah, persahabatan dan dendam muncul.\n\nSiapa yang akan merebut takhta pada akhirnya?","alternative_title":"Myeongwang, 명왕","author":"Major, Geum Gi Hyeok","artist":"Geum Gi Hyeok","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"6af7f13b-28d5-44eb-aa96-869f910ed010","number":"50","chapter":"50","title":"","date":"2025-12-08","released":"2025-12-08","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_284722b0-1b2f-4e94-bc09-3bcfac719c17/chapter_ch_50/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_284722b0-1b2f-4e94-bc09-3bcfac719c17/chapter_ch_50/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_284722b0-1b2f-4e94-bc09-3bcfac719c17/chapter_ch_50/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_284722b0-1b2f-4e94-bc09-3bcfac719c17/chapter_ch_50/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_284722b0-1b2f-4e94-bc09-3bcfac719c17/chapter_ch_50/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_284722b0-1b2f-4e94-bc09-3bcfac719c17/chapter_ch_50/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_284722b0-1b2f-4e94-bc09-3bcfac719c17/chapter_ch_50/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_284722b0-1b2f-4e94-bc09-3bcfac719c17/chapter_ch_50/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_284722b0-1b2f-4e94-bc09-3bcfac719c17/chapter_ch_50/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_284722b0-1b2f-4e94-bc09-3bcfac719c17/chapter_ch_50/10.webp"]},{"chapter_id":"560b31d5-2794-424a-aa28-accb01aa592e","number":"49","chapter":"49","title":"","date":"2025-12-01","released":"2025-12-01","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_284722b0-1b2f-4e94-bc09-3bcfac719c17/chapter_ch_49/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_284722b0-1b2f-4e94-bc09-3bcfac719c17/chapter_ch_49/2.webp","https://assets